{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Control a Small, Quirky Adventurer</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tiny is new to the adventuring life. His skills are little in comparison to his heroic peers, nevertheless he will take on the challenge to climb the unclimbable mountain. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >His journey will take him through ancient civilisations and vast wildernesses across his world. Faced with legendary foes and troublesome traps, he must hide or learn to fight.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore and Adapt</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find or Create paths through the peaks and caves of the jungle. Help others research its plants, animals, and history. Learn from Tiny's heroes and gain awesome abilities.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Artefacts, Destruction, and a world Alive</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take artefacts to a researcher, use their powers, or sell them to private collectors. Or, leave them be. Enjoy the environments, go sightseeing, and try not to destroy anything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3953450?t=1761682274","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3953450?t=1761682274","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953450/4b17ec10794c735b95ff5e23317769ed3bbbdd6f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761682274","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953450/4b17ec10794c735b95ff5e23317769ed3bbbdd6f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761682274","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Control a Small, Quirky Adventurer</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tiny is new to the adventuring life. His skills are little in comparison to his heroic peers, nevertheless he will take on the challenge to climb the unclimbable mountain. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >His journey will take him through ancient civilisations and vast wildernesses across his world. Faced with legendary foes and troublesome traps, he must hide or learn to fight.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore and Adapt</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find or Create paths through the peaks and caves of the jungle. Help others research its plants, animals, and history. Learn from Tiny's heroes and gain awesome abilities.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Artefacts, Destruction, and a world Alive</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take artefacts to a researcher, use their powers, or sell them to private collectors. Or, leave them be. Enjoy the environments, go sightseeing, and try not to destroy anything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["teunu","Tilia Media"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953450/86ff30836359dc9ae3beee81fb3a8ae3eb04a9f6/header.jpg?t=1761682274","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"Tiny Adventure Game","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-6100 / AMD FX-6300 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 2 GB VRAM<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["teunu"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"","rating":"l","rating_generate